      "data": {
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## Placement Contract\n\nConsume **Collection Capability Export** through a real import bridge with `nodeClasses: allow`, `scripts: allow`, and explicit read, create, execute, runtime, update, and delete grants. The consumer Legend receives two entries:\n\n1. **Collection Surface**\n2. **Collection Window Controller**\n\nThe Controller is a real Script node. Icon, Summary, and Detail are operational firing surfaces backed by one declared paging-event vocabulary; Editor is configuration entered explicitly through the node context menu. The bridge deliberately exposes executable graph capability to the host. Place each entry once; the host graph retains its own identity and membership policy."
        }
      },
